      "answer": "The currently imported lecture does not contain any information about the StudyGraph service, its response times, or any P95 latency metrics. The lecture content focuses on CPU multicore programming, race conditions, CUDA threads, instruction pipelines, and performance models for parallel programs [S1][S2][S3][S4][S5][S6][S7][S8][S9].\n\nTherefore, I cannot provide today's actual P95 response time for the local StudyGraph service based on the available lecture material.",
