          "chunk_id": "34911c46e78edc833f283f8dd678b85d6f8c92d66859e6bf6886949181d95402-p57-1",
          "page": 57,
          "text": "CPU Multicore Programming: pThread\n  Race Condition and Critical Section\n¡  Example\n   ¡ sum += local_sum;\n   ¡  For each thread\n     ¡ Load sum\n     ¡ Add local_sum\n     ¡ Store sum\n   ¡   If two threads execute concurrently\n     ¡ both may read the old value;\n     ¡ both compute new values;\n     ¡ one write overwrites the other.\n\n\n\n   ¡ Race Conditions: multiple threads access a\n      shared resource and final result depends on\n      timing.\n   ¡ A critical section is code that must be\n     executed by only one thread at a time.",
          "preview_url": "/api/documents/34911c46e78edc833f283f8dd678b85d6f8c92d66859e6bf6886949181d95402/pages/57/preview",
