          "page": 62,
          "text": "                                                           blockDim.x is the number of threads per block.\n                                                                             threadIdx.x is the local index inside that block.\n\n¡ Every CUDA thread runs the same kernel\n  code; built-in IDs select the data element.\n\n                                  i = blockIdx.x * blockDim.x + threadIdx.x",
          "preview_url": "/api/documents/34911c46e78edc833f283f8dd678b85d6f8c92d66859e6bf6886949181d95402/pages/62/preview",
